  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag1" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;1. None&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;2.&amp;#160;On&amp;#160;February 28, 2025, Plains All American Pipeline, L.P. ("Plains") acquired the remaining 50% membership interest in&amp;#160;Cheyenne Pipeline LLC&amp;#160;(&amp;#8220;Cheyenne&amp;#8221;) from a subsidiary of HF Sinclair Corporation (the &amp;#8220;Transaction&amp;#8221;). Following the Transaction, Plains is the sole owner of Cheyenne, holding a 100% ownership interest.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font&gt;As a result of the change in control the Transaction was accounted for in accordance with Accounting Standards Codification 805, Business Combinations, and Cheyenne&amp;#8217;s assets and liabilities were recorded at fair market value as of the date of the Transaction.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;3. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;4. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;5. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag2" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;On&amp;#160;February 28, 2025, Plains All American Pipeline, L.P. ("Plains") acquired the remaining 50% membership interest in&amp;#160;Cheyenne Pipeline LLC&amp;#160;(&amp;#8220;Cheyenne&amp;#8221;) from a subsidiary of HF Sinclair Corporation (the &amp;#8220;Transaction&amp;#8221;). Following the Transaction, Plains is the sole owner of Cheyenne, holding a 100% ownership interest.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;As a result of the change in control the Transaction was accounted for in accordance with Accounting Standards Codification 805, Business Combinations, and Cheyenne&amp;#8217;s assets and liabilities were recorded at fair market value as of the date of the Transaction.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
